天下豪桀并兼之家，亂眾之民，皆可徙茂陵，內實京師，外銷姦猾，此所謂不誅而害除。」上又從其計。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m022-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"偃","kind":"person","person_id":"vbr_ff1_yc4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m022-0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m022-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"晁錯","kind":"person","person_id":"7mt_qrc_04e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m022-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m022-0138","start":138,"end":139,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m022-0158","start":158,"end":159,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m022-0165","start":165,"end":166,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m022-0214","start":214,"end":215,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","book_id":"b-shiji-112","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-112","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin","source":{"title":"史記／卷112","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷112","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷112&oldid=2089420","revision_id":2089420,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定數位見證31段；末三段分為後附詔書、班固贊及索隱述贊。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversi